# Surge iOS 6.x；替换旧版同名模块，避免重复处理。不修改全局 DNS、CA 或代理。

[Script]
戒烟军团会员解锁 = type=http-response,pattern=^http://smoke\.nxnresearch\.com/webservice510\.asmx(?:[/?]|$),requires-body=true,max-size=1048576,binary-body-mode=true,full-header-mode=true,engine=webview,script-update-interval=3600,script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/atopsecret/SurgeScripts/main/jyjt/jyjt-member.js?v=1.0.0,timeout=10
